 "name_en": "Batch Management (BLF)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Batch Management (BLF)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Batch Management incorporates the entire logistics process, from procurement to sales. It is closely linked with classification, but can also be used without classification.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Batch Management is defined as tagging a produced or procured material with a unique 10-digit alphanumeric code. Every batch number can have an inventory quantity associated with it.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The batch number generated for the material quantity helps with uniquely sorting the material inventory and stores the characteristics values or the chemical composition or the product specifications at the time of its production or procurement.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">A customizing object <strong class=\"ph b\">Specify Batch Management Default by Plant</strong> is available, which enables you to specify whether batch management is used by default in Material Master for each plant.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">If column <strong class=\"ph b\">not batch relevant</strong> of a plant is checked, the plant will not use batch management by default when a new material is set as batch managed. You can still overwrite this setting later by maintaining Material Master with plant data.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Batch derivation customizing objects are available with both applications and self service configuration UIs. You can use batch derivation scenario after finishing the configuration. Batch derivation enables you to do the following for batch master data and classification data of the component batches of produced batches:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89__ul_b31_ny1_5xb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display for selection</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and change batch master data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View batch history: Top-down and Bottom-up Analysis</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Fast search and display of batches with Enterprise Search</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign batch number</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Specify batch</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage batch status</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View batch where-used list</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage batches from supplier receipt through distribution with full traceability</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Identify differences in usage and monitoring of materials planning in SD and Production</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Trace defects and initiate follow up actions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Comply to legal requirements, such as Good Manufacturing Practice or hazardous material regulations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Differentiate quantity- and value-based inventory, for example, due to heterogeneous yield or result qualities or varying constituents in Production</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve settlement of material quantities based on batch specifications</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>批次管理 (BLF)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">批次管理包含从采购到销售的整个物流流程。它与分类密切相关，但也可以不通过分类使用。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">批次管理定义为使用唯一的 10 位字母数字代码标记生产或采购的物料。每个批次编号都可以具有与其相关联的库存数量。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">为物料数量生成的批次编号有助于唯一排序物料库存，并在生产或采购时存储特征值、化学品成分或产品规格。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">定制对象<strong class=\"ph b\">按工厂指定批次管理缺省值</strong>可用，使您能够指定缺省情况下是否在每个工厂的物料主数据中使用批次管理。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">如果选中与工厂<strong class=\"ph b\">批次无关</strong>的列，则在将新物料设置为按批次管理时，工厂缺省情况下不会使用批次管理。稍后仍可以通过使用工厂数据维护物料主数据来覆盖此设置。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">批次派生定制对象可用于应用程序和自助服务配置 UI。您可以在完成配置后使用批次派生场景。通过批次派生，您可以为生产批次的组件批次的批次主数据和分类数据执行以下操作：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89__ul_b31_ny1_5xb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">传输</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示选择</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建和更改批次主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看批次历史记录：自上而下和自下而上分析</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用企业搜索快速搜索和显示批次</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分配批次编号</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">指定批次</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理批次状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看批次使用位置清单</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50561fc0192042b691ca3f613524ae89__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">从供应商收货到分销管理批次，并具有完全可追溯性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">识别 SD 和生产中物料计划的使用和监控差异</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">跟踪缺陷并启动后续操作</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">符合法律要求，例如货物制造实践或危险物料法规</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">区分基于数量和价值的库存，例如，由于异构产量或结果质量或生产中的不同组成部分</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据批次规范改进物料数量的结算</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
